        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Kindergarten Daily Routine</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: sans-serif;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            margin: 20px;\n            color: #000;\n        }\n        .container {\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .indent-1 {\n            margin-left: 2em;\n        }\n        .indent-2 {\n            margin-left: 4em;\n        }\n        .indent-3 {\n            margin-left: 6em;\n        }\n        .bold {\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        .flex-row {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n        .label {\n            width: 80px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .content {\n            flex-grow: 1;\n        }\n        .list-item {\n            display: flex;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n        .list-number {\n            width: 1.5em;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .list-text {\n            flex-grow: 1;\n        }\n        .note {\n            margin-left: 2em;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .section-title {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-top: 15px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"indent-3\">学工作。</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"flex-row bold\">\n            <div class=\"label\" style=\"width: 100px;\">教育活动</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">小班9:10－9:50 中大班9:10－10:00</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex-row\">\n            <div class=\"label\">主班教师：</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">1.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">按教学进度有计划地组织教学活动。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">2.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">活动过程符合《纲要》《指南》精神，注重激发幼儿自主学习、主动学习、结构完整、重难点突出、自然流畅、教学方法灵活、突出学科特点。</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"note\">\n            （注：中大班集体教学活动不得超过25分钟，小班一节集体教育活动不超过15分钟，其余为游戏活动）。\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex-row\">\n            <div class=\"label\">保育员：</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">1.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">走动、说话声音要轻,不影响幼儿和教师活动。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">2.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">协助教师对个别需要帮助的幼儿进行适度指导。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">3.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">活动结束后帮助教师收拾、整理教具。</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section-title\">10:00-10:10喝水 如厕</div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex-row indent-1\">\n            <div class=\"label\" style=\"width: 60px;\">幼儿：</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">1.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">根据需要如厕、有序洗手，用自己的水杯按量喝水，不玩水、不洒水。</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex-row\">\n            <div class=\"label\">主班老师：</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">1.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">组织幼儿有序如厕、洗手、喝水。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">2.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">上、下午各组织三次集体喝水,并提醒幼儿随渴随喝。</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex-row\">\n            <div class=\"label\">保育员：</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">1.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">组织幼儿有序如厕、洗手、喝水。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">2.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">保证班上有充足的温开水，上、下午各组织三次集体喝水,并提醒幼儿随渴随喝。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">3.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">保持桌面、地面干燥洁净。</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section-title\">10:10-10:40课间操及户外活动</div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex-row indent-1\">\n            <div class=\"label\" style=\"width: 60px;\">幼儿：</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">1.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">整理服装、系好鞋带，愉快地参加体育活动。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">2.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">有秩序地上下楼，不推挤、不打闹，。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">3.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">做操队列整齐、精神饱满、有节奏、有力度。（中大班幼儿会领操）</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">4.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">熟悉并探究各种各类体育器械的玩法，动作灵活、协调。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">5.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">遵守游戏规则，有自我保护意识，不追逐打闹、不做危险动作。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">6.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">根据需要喝水、如厕、整理衣服。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">7.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">能在较冷、较热户外环境中坚持活动。</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex-row\">\n            <div class=\"label\">主班老师：</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">1.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">集中整队，清点人数，检查服装、鞋子并进行安全与规则教育。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">2.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">镜面领操，动作准确到位，观察幼儿做操动作并随机指导。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">4.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">在自己的视线范围内组织各类活动，集体活动与自由活动相结合，确保每日1小时的体育活动。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">5.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">能根据幼儿脸色、出汗等情况及时调节活动内容和运动量。</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"list-number\">6.</div>\n                    <div class=\"list-text\">根据天气变化、运动情况和个体需要，及时提醒幼儿增减衣服、饮水、擦汗。</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
